atchRatio":0.47975},{"ratio":0.87,"watchRatio":0.47285},{"ratio":0.88,"watchRatio":0.46830000000000005},{"ratio":0.89,"watchRatio":0.46485},{"ratio":0.9,"watchRatio":0.46285},{"ratio":0.91,"watchRatio":0.4583},{"ratio":0.92,"watchRatio":0.4518},{"ratio":0.93,"watchRatio":0.4476},{"ratio":0.94,"watchRatio":0.44489999999999996},{"ratio":0.95,"watchRatio":0.43825000000000003},{"ratio":0.96,"watchRatio":0.4322},{"ratio":0.97,"watchRatio":0.42300000000000004},{"ratio":0.98,"watchRatio":0.40980000000000005},{"ratio":0.99,"watchRatio":0.39725},{"ratio":1,"watchRatio":0.39294999999999997}],"script":{"source_path":"KsezqBPF41E.en-orig.vtt","words":290,"wpm":null,"lang":"en","chapters":[],"blocks":[{"sec":0,"text":"So, is this idea of ancestral"},{"sec":2,"text":"professions unique to India? No, it was"},{"sec":4,"text":"not. I mean, in the pre-industrial era,"},{"sec":5.6,"text":"it was like like fairly common. In"},{"sec":7.2,"text":"Europe, you'll find it. In Japan, you'll"},{"sec":8.8,"text":"find it. In so many other places, also,"},{"sec":10.9,"text":"you'll find it, right? And then again,"},{"sec":13.3,"text":"another aspect that is attributed is"},{"sec":16,"text":"like endogamy, right? So, castes are"},{"sec":18.2,"text":"these very strict endogamous groups, and"},{"sec":20.1,"text":"they try to police who needs to marry"},{"sec":22.3,"text":"whom and all of that, right? So, was"},{"sec":24,"text":"this unique to India? Again, you'd see"},{"sec":26,"text":"endogamy also was practiced in lot of"},{"sec":27.8,"text":"places in lot of shape. So, again, like"},{"sec":30,"text":"like going to even things like like more"},{"sec":32.5,"text":"controversial"},{"sec":33.4,"text":">> [music]"},{"sec":33.7,"text":">> areas like untouchability and all of"},{"sec":35.4,"text":"that, right? So, was like all members of"},{"sec":38.4,"text":"all groups free to do whatever they want"},{"sec":40.3,"text":"with all members of other groups? No, it"},{"sec":42.2,"text":"was not like that. Again,"},{"sec":43.7,"text":"pre-industrial Europe, how did they look"},{"sec":45.8,"text":"at certain professions of people who are"},{"sec":48.3,"text":"doing like skinning of animals or who"},{"sec":51,"text":"are doing the job of an undertaker, who"},{"sec":53,"text":"used to like you know, the the groups"},{"sec":55.3,"text":"that used to be in charge of graveyards"},{"sec":57.1,"text":"and things like that, right? In the"},{"sec":58.3,"text":"European context, you'll see lot of"},{"sec":60.8,"text":"these kind of restrictions [music] that"},{"sec":62.8,"text":"are here attributed to some of those"},{"sec":65,"text":"professions in the Indian context,"},{"sec":66.2,"text":"[music] right? So, I think these kind of"},{"sec":68.3,"text":"things you will find a lot of"},{"sec":70.4,"text":"similarities. What is perhaps, I think,"},{"sec":73.6,"text":"distinct in the Indian context or in the"},{"sec":76,"text":"context of Sanatana Dharma is perhaps, I"},{"sec":78.3,"text":"think, I mean, the the intensity of how"},{"sec":81,"text":"much each of this was sacralized, right?"},{"sec":83.6,"text":"I think that is perhaps like very unique"},{"sec":85.9,"text":"in the Indian context."}],"text":""}}